{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3370, "text": "I'm a little worried about Harry."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5250, "text": "He hasn't been himself since Margaret...\nDumped him?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9770, "text": "Well, I would have chosen a different\nword."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 15230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11990, "text": "Anyway, what happened? They were so\nhappy together, then all of a sudden"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 17510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15230, "text": "gone. Well, I guess that's life."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 20210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18050, "text": "Two ships passing in the night."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 24530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 20870, "text": "Well, I hope her ship gets torpedoed and\nrots at the bottom of the sea."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 27110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25350, "text": "Come on, Roz, we don't know what\nhappened."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 29690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 27650, "text": "Anyway, why is it so important to find\nBlaine?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 31410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30170, "text": "Because she hurt Harry."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 33990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32030, "text": "Look at him. He's buttering a tie."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 39210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38210, "text": "Hi, Harry."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 40650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39650, "text": "Feeling any better?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 45350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42270, "text": "Well, wounds of the heart take time to\nheal."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 50950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47570, "text": "I just want you to know I'm your friend,\nand I'm here for you."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54010, "text": "What a loser."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 60310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57510, "text": "Guess who's playing in town this week?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 62870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61870, "text": "Meals for me."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 64370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63310, "text": "Hey, that's it."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 67390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64590, "text": "That would be just the thing to snap\nHarry out of his doldrums. Yeah."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 69810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67810, "text": "How about we all chip in and buy him\nsome good seeds?"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 72170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70530, "text": "Seeds? Why would he need seeds?"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 73510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72510, "text": "Oh, yes."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 74810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 73810, "text": "One for his coat."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 79730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76310, "text": "Dan, just for once in your life, could\nyou show just a little compassion for a"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 80730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79730, "text": "person in pain?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 83250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82250, "text": "You're right. I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 86450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85450, "text": "I'm ashamed of myself."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 94640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93320, "text": "Here's some jam for that tie."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 146180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 143440, "text": "I did call the nightclub, and I spoke to\nMel Torme himself."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 147680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 146680, "text": "Do you know what this means?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 150800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 148360, "text": "His career's on the skids, and he's\nforced to work the switchboard?"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 156500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152000, "text": "No. I told him the whole story, and not\nonly will Harry have the best seats in"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 159780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 156500, "text": "the house, but the tickets will be\ndelivered tonight by Mel Torme himself."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 163120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160180, "text": "Here. I sure hope this makes Harry\nhappy."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 165080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163340, "text": "I haven't seen him smile in weeks."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 166600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165340, "text": "Well, I've taken care of that."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 168520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166860, "text": "I rearranged the docket."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 171460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168920, "text": "The first case is a Harry special."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 175400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174280, "text": "Bull, you're over."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 181260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180260, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 184120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182340, "text": "Criminal Court Part 2 is now in session."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 186520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184480, "text": "The Honorable Harold T. Stone presiding."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 190700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187500, "text": "You have no idea how sick I am of\nhearing that."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 192960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191360, "text": "I could try it with an accent, sir."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 195140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193460, "text": "I do a mean Scottish burr."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 197400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196400, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 200120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197680, "text": "Criminal Court Part 2 is now in session.\nBull!"}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 206110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204810, "text": "Call it, Mac. Oh, yes, sir."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 208010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206910, "text": "Here we go."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 213050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 210590, "text": "People versus the chicken."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 215950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213970, "text": "You're going to love this one, sir."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 221910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217190, "text": "Prosecution? Yes, sir. Mr. DeChicken was\narrested on the West Side Highway while"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 227070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221910, "text": "illegally attempting to walk from the\nnorthbound to the southbound lanes,"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 230490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227410, "text": "leading police to ask the inevitable\nquestion."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 235700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234700, "text": "Which is?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 238060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236280, "text": "Oh, come on, sir. You know the question."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 240040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239040, "text": "About Mr."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 241880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 240880, "text": "DeChicken."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 244540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242900, "text": "What question?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 248700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245740, "text": "Why did DeChicken cross the road?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 258200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254500, "text": "To get himself a $500 fine for public\nendangerment."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 259480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 258480, "text": "Take him away."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 262120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260339, "text": "That wasn't the right answer, sir."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 266760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262920, "text": "Well, that is my answer, Counselor. And\nthat's the way things are going to be"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 269120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266760, "text": "around here from now on. No more fooling\naround."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 271580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269560, "text": "This is a place of serious business."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 277040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 272660, "text": "Now, we'll take a five -minute recess\nwhile the clerk rearranges the docket to"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 278880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277040, "text": "represent some semblance of order."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 284500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282480, "text": "Lucky we didn't call the next case."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 286079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285120, "text": "Oh, right."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 287760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286080, "text": "The Albanian cab driver."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 291020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288860, "text": "People versus Nug Nug Who's Dare."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 297140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296140, "text": "Stupid place."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 298740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 297440, "text": "Stupid job."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 301840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299800, "text": "Okay, who turned out the lights?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 307300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306220, "text": "Get out of here, Art."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 310460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307580, "text": "You know, I'm trying to fix your couch.\nGet the hell out."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 312480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311480, "text": "Okay, fine."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 315000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312500, "text": "But when you get a string up your butt,\ndon't come crying to me."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 319000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317780, "text": "What am I doing here?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 321560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320160, "text": "I'm not making any difference."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 323960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322240, "text": "I never should have taken this job."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 329250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327630, "text": "Because then I wouldn't have met you,\nMargaret."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 338750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333610, "text": "I wouldn't have a girlfriend in the\nFederal Witness Relocation Program."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 346450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340970, "text": "Or if I'd gone with you, I wouldn't be\nstuck here, where I mean nothing."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 357100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354060, "text": "Life would have been a lot better if I'd\nnever come here."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 363020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362020, "text": "Hello, Harry."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 365620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364620, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 369420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368420, "text": "Mel?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 372220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370520, "text": "Mel? Who's Mel?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 374680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373680, "text": "Mel Torme."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 380680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375960, "text": "Boy, I must really be depressed because\nI'm not even excited to see you."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 383560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381620, "text": "I look like Mel Torme?"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 386760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385420, "text": "This isn't funny, Mel."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 390160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387520, "text": "Will you stop with the Mel? The name's\nHerb."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 391980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390980, "text": "Herb?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 394280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392600, "text": "I'm your guardian angel."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 396620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395480, "text": "My guardian angel."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 403160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398420, "text": "Mel, I don't know who put you up to\nthis, but I'm really not in the mood,"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 406580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403340, "text": "So why don't you come back some other\ntime? Oh, this is the way you treat"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 407760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406580, "text": "someone who saved your life?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 410720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408480, "text": "What? Remember when you were a kid?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 415040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411200, "text": "trying to impress your friends, hanging\non the back of a crosstown bus."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 418740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417400, "text": "And my fingers flipped."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 421220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419980, "text": "I started to fall."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 425040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421540, "text": "But something, someone, pushed you back\non."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 427420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 426420, "text": "You?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 428680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427680, "text": "Ta -da!"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 435220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431040, "text": "If you're an angel named Herb, how come\nyou look like Mel Torme?"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 440360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435800, "text": "Well, maybe you want me to look like Mel\nTorme. I personally..."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 442030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440750, "text": "would have chosen Wayne Newton."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 446590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 444370, "text": "I have a guardian angel? Harry."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 450550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446830, "text": "Harry. Harry, I've watched over you all\nyour life."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 451990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450990, "text": "See?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 457990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454870, "text": "You were such a cute baby."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 460810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459590, "text": "There's me and my mom."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 465510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461390, "text": "And there's my teddy bear, Jamboree. I\nlove Jamboree. I remember."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 468050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466690, "text": "Listen, look, look, look."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 469810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468270, "text": "There's you in the third grade."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 472150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470170, "text": "Okay, there's Boy Scout camp."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 475130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472530, "text": "Oh, look, look, I took this one the\nnight of your senior prom."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 478650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475470, "text": "I didn't go. I know, you spent the\nevening with... With Jamboree."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 483230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481070, "text": "Herb, I gotta admit, this is very\nimpressive."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 485670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484670, "text": "It's a living."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 488950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487670, "text": "Well, what are you doing here now?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 496510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489870, "text": "Well, I heard you say that you wish\nyou'd never come here, that it didn't"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 497990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496510, "text": "matter. Oh, it doesn't."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 503440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498860, "text": "I haven't made any difference here,\nHerb. Oh, Harry, Harry, you're really"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 505280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503440, "text": "hurting. And you need my help."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 508700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506840, "text": "Let's go for a walk."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 511120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509940, "text": "Where are you going to take me?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 514100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511620, "text": "Some magic land beyond the clouds or\nsomething?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 516159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514799, "text": "No, the hallway."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 521480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516780, "text": "I want you to see what life would be\nlike around here without Harry Stone."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 533400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532220, "text": "Everything's in black and white."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 538500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534320, "text": "This is how the world would have been if\nI hadn't been around. No green grass or"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 540820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538500, "text": "blue sky, just shades of gray."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 543960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541280, "text": "No, it's just a device I use to\nillustrate my point."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 545580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544220, "text": "You're an old movie fan, right?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 547420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545880, "text": "You gotta ask? Right."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 548820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547820, "text": "Come on inside."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 550820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548900, "text": "Now, nobody in there can see us or hear\nus."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 553680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551080, "text": "The first reel is about to begin."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 576520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572720, "text": "Well? Well, what? Christine's still here\nand there's Matt."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 578640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576720, "text": "Where did I make a difference?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 580340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579340, "text": "Watch."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 585760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583720, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 590060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586640, "text": "Court is now in session."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 593800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590460, "text": "The Honorable Daniel R."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 595020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594020, "text": "Fielding."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 617840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616780, "text": "Dan is the judge?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 620460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618360, "text": "Well, you weren't on the list, so he got\nyour appointment."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 625340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620900, "text": "He's been on the bench for about the\npast eight years and making the most of"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 630660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628680, "text": "The Deputy May is on his way, Chief."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 633760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630940, "text": "Perfect. I hear the Dan Filko plans for\nthe Central Park renovation."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 637620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634280, "text": "Right, Chief. I want every one of his\npolitical chips pulled in on this one."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 638980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637760, "text": "Right, Chief. And one more thing."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 640340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639340, "text": "Don't call me Chief."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 645160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643980, "text": "Dan Filko?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 649790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645790, "text": "Well, that's a little real estate\ndevelopment business that he runs on the"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 652090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649790, "text": "when he's not dispensing his brand of\njustice."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 654330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 653330, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 658810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655150, "text": "he can't be that bad a judge. I mean,\nChristine's still working here."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 662290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659530, "text": "That's not the same Christine you knew."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 666330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 662490, "text": "I mean, all those high ideals and\ndedication that she had early on,"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 670270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666330, "text": "vanished. Fielding doesn't exactly treat\nher with your brand of respect and"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 671270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670270, "text": "gentility."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 672910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671910, "text": "Counselor?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 674170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673170, "text": "Yes, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 676710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675710, "text": "Nice gams."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 679390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 678390, "text": "Thank you, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 682770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 681030, "text": "So how come Mac is sitting over here?"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 684390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683090, "text": "Well, he's the district attorney."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 686210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685210, "text": "Well, that's good."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 689550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686510, "text": "It means that if I hadn't been around,\nMac could have furthered his career."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 691250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689810, "text": "That doesn't say much for me, Herb."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 694810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 691450, "text": "Okay, he's a lawyer, but he's divorced,\nhe's bitter, he's lonely."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 697490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 695450, "text": "He's got a chronic gastric condition."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 703470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701850, "text": "He needed your friendship."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 707390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705390, "text": "Miss Wagner, time to call the first\ncase."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 714270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709230, "text": "Judge Fielding, wouldn't it be more\nexpedient if the files were kept over by"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 716150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714270, "text": "desk? More expedient, yes."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 717930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716910, "text": "More fun, no."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 720370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719370, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 723710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722030, "text": "People versus ornaments."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 725490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724470, "text": "Breaking and entering."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 734700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730250, "text": "Prosecution. Yes, sir. Mr. Arnovitz here\nwas apprehended by the police breaking"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 735700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734700, "text": "Davis' wallpaper."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 740540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736060, "text": "In his possession were burglar's tools\nand $9 ,000 in company payroll checks."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 743660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 741280, "text": "Sounds bad, Arnovitz. Defense?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 745460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744460, "text": "Geez, none really."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 749740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745720, "text": "I mean, it's just pretty open in chat.\nMy client asked for the mercy of the"}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 750780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749740, "text": "court. Mercy?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 753840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751000, "text": "What possible reason would I have to\nshow mercy, Mr. Arnovitz?"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 757360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 754200, "text": "My contribution to the annual judge's\nball, perhaps?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 762490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760490, "text": "And a very healthy contribution it is,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 767870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763850, "text": "In my judgment, this was just a\nmomentary lapse in an otherwise"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 770650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767870, "text": "citizen's exemplary life."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 774970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 770930, "text": "Oh, come on, sir. This man has 35 prior\narrests. Silence. I'm still judging."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 776110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775110, "text": "Case dismissed."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 777850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776850, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 781530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778930, "text": "This isn't justice. This is an outrage."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 784010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781950, "text": "This is Fielding's court."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 787250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785830, "text": "I need some air."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 797870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795470, "text": "I mean, if I wasn't around, the\ncafeteria would be closed."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 800910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798190, "text": "No, it's not closed. You just have to\nknow the password."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 802810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801810, "text": "Password?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 808270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807270, "text": "Not me."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 814990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813990, "text": "Jack."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 816670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815330, "text": "And he's not blind anymore."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 821490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816870, "text": "That's true. But his taste buds don't\nfunction. He has never enjoyed a meal."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 830260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829260, "text": "What happened to the cafeteria?"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 834020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831500, "text": "Fielding turned it into a private club\nfor his friends."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 838060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834500, "text": "The booze and gambling and... Livette?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 841500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838440, "text": "Cigars, cigarettes, confiscated\nevidence."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 845200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843020, "text": "Hey. Next unit."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 846640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845460, "text": "Next unit, please."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 850880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 847060, "text": "The deputy mayor's outside. He wants to\ncome in, but he can't remember the"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 852620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850880, "text": "password. What a jerk."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 854800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853200, "text": "Your Honor, come on in."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 859880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858880, "text": "Swordfish."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 862340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860880, "text": "Oh, yeah, that's close enough, sir."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 864380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862880, "text": "Place your bet. Place your bet."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 870500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865320, "text": "Bull is the deputy mayor of New York.\nYeah, Fielding set it up. He needed a"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 874960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870500, "text": "stooge. But who would be stupid enough\nto vote for Bull? Oh, we ran a great"}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 878940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874960, "text": "campaign. The slogan was, what I don't\nknow won't hurt you."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 881480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 879340, "text": "Okay, now these are the chief's plans."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 882920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881740, "text": "You know what to do with them."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 886360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883700, "text": "Dan Fieldco's renovation of Central\nPark."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 888200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887200, "text": "Hmm."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 892180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888840, "text": "He wants to tear down the carousel and\nput in a pair of mutual dog tracks?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 895100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892460, "text": "Sure. There's big boxing and greyhounds."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 898320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895920, "text": "Replace the petting zoo with a hunting\nzoo?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 900340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899340, "text": "Peep shows?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 903340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901620, "text": "A mud wrestling stadium?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 907220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905620, "text": "I'm not sure about this."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 911540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907700, "text": "Just use your influence and push it\nthrough the city council. And that's an"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 912540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911540, "text": "order."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 915180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912680, "text": "Judge Fielding's sure this is going to\nget me elected mayor."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 917960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916720, "text": "It's in the bag."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 922310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921310, "text": "Well, gotta go."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 925450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922890, "text": "Got some real serious city business to\ntake care of."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 928330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926650, "text": "I'm cutting the cable on a new elevator."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 930170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928930, "text": "You mean cut the ribbon."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 933890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932050, "text": "Well, I ran into you."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 936550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934790, "text": "A tray for the gentleman on table three."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 939190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937610, "text": "Man, this is getting scary."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 942250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940750, "text": "Isn't that Roz going by?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 943650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942650, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 945590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944010, "text": "And she's in handcuffs."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 965550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961550, "text": "Miss Wagner, who's our next contestant\non if the prize is right?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 969070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966870, "text": "People versus Roz Russell."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 970750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969750, "text": "What's her scam?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 975190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972970, "text": "Demonstrating without a permit."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 978270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976330, "text": "What? There's no money in that."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 986870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982090, "text": "Wow. I mean, if I hadn't been here, Roz\nwould have turned into a criminal."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 989790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987250, "text": "Oh, don't get too full of yourself,\nHarry. She's no criminal."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 992910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990170, "text": "Get your hands off me. I didn't do\nanything wrong."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 995490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993290, "text": "I'll be the judge of that. What's it all\nabout?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 998470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995790, "text": "Your Honor, my client merely led a\npicket line in front of her landlord's"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 999470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998470, "text": "corporate offices."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1001270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000270, "text": "Big deal."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1002950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001570, "text": "It is a big deal."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1007710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003410, "text": "I live in an apartment building filled\nwith good, hardworking people. People"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1009590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007710, "text": "take pride in themselves and their home."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1011470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010470, "text": "So?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1015910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011690, "text": "So, a year ago, our building was taken\nover by a new management company who"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1019870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015910, "text": "tripled our rent, sold our fire escape\nfor scrap metal, and gassed all our"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1022030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1021030, "text": "So?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1026310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022450, "text": "So, I decided we'd had enough. It was\ntime to take action."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1029190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026609, "text": "This morning, I led all the tenants down\nto corporate headquarters."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1031690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029630, "text": "All we wanted was to speak to the owner."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1036550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033250, "text": "Yeah, well, what's the name of this\nheartless landlord?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1038349, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037349, "text": "Dan Philco."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1043740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040940, "text": "The people see no case here, sir. We\nwish to drop the charges."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1047400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044220, "text": "And you would say, man, this woman is a\nmenace to society."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1052100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047859, "text": "No, she's not. Let this be a lesson to\nanyone who would stand in the way of"}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1054400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052100, "text": "enterprise. Ten years, hard labor."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1056060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055060, "text": "Oh, no!"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1057840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056840, "text": "No, Christine!"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1062260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058700, "text": "Mac, come on, somebody do something.\nDon't let them take Ross to jail."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1064920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062600, "text": "They can't hear you, Harry. You're not\nhere."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1067120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1065140, "text": "I've had enough of this. I don't want to\nsee you anymore."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1069060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067960, "text": "I want to go back."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1076459, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075560, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1077640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076460, "text": "This isn't my chambers."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1079120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078100, "text": "Who are those people?"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1082180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079400, "text": "Well, that's Dan, his wife Diane, and\nhis son Damien."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1086280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083440, "text": "Damien? As in? The Antichrist."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1090920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087620, "text": "Reverend Counselor, you wanted to see\nme? Your Honor, I've got something on my"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1092820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090920, "text": "mind I want to say, and I don't want you\nto interrupt me."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1095600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093140, "text": "Champagne? No, I don't want champagne. I\nwant to talk to you."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1099480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096620, "text": "When I came here six years ago, I came\nhere with one purpose, and that was to"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1100480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099480, "text": "serve the people."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1102280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100960, "text": "Bonbon. No."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1106170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103050, "text": "But over time, I've allowed myself to be\ndragged down to your level, and I just"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1107170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1106170, "text": "can't take it anymore."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1108310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107250, "text": "Good for you, Christine."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1111330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108770, "text": "The Russell case just now proved to me\nthat all hope is lost."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1113430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111810, "text": "So I give up. I resign."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1116390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1113770, "text": "But I'm going to do everything in my\npower to make sure that you and your"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1118170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116390, "text": "corrupt organization are brought down."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1122870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118450, "text": "Yeah, see that, Herb? There is a happy\nending. Christine wins and Dan loses."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1129030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1123690, "text": "You know, Miss Sullivan, I've always\nadmired your pluck."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1133460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131020, "text": "Really gonna miss you around here. Oh,\ndon't try that with me, Buster."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1135380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133680, "text": "Yeah, don't try that with her, Buster."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1137480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136480, "text": "She's got to go."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1144220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137720, "text": "I've always suspected that through that\nbleeding heart of yours flowed the blood"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1145220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144220, "text": "of passion."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1147220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145860, "text": "Well, I think you've heard enough."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1148440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147440, "text": "You're leaving, remember?"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1153000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1149020, "text": "And now that we're no longer colleagues,\nI'm going to tell you a cold, hard fact"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1154620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1153000, "text": "about yourself, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1156440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155040, "text": "Oh, what is that?"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1160240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157580, "text": "For the last six years, you've wanted..."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1162420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161420, "text": "Only me."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1165180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162880, "text": "Ha! Don't make me laugh."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1167520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165580, "text": "Ha! Don't make her laugh."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1172880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168080, "text": "She's got to go. You find me amazingly\nattractive."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1176260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1173500, "text": "I find you absolutely repulsive."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1178380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1176680, "text": "Not telling him. Now say goodbye."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1182500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178680, "text": "Time to face the inevitable, Miss\nSullivan."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1183900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182880, "text": "I hate you."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1187660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184180, "text": "I hate you. I hate you. I hate you."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1191010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1188830, "text": "Love you. I knew it."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1195270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192550, "text": "No, Christine, not you too."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1197050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196050, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1201430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198130, "text": "I've seen enough. I don't want to do\nthis anymore. I don't want to live in"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1203870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201430, "text": "color. I want to be the judge."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1205190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204190, "text": "This is insane."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1207890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205630, "text": "Don't holler. You're back already."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1210810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209810, "text": "I am."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1212510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211390, "text": "Look, fresh tones."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1216700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213320, "text": "And these crummy yellow walls. Oh, how I\nmiss you both."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1218300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216940, "text": "And this Jack. Look, Jack."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1219479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218500, "text": "And he's blind."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1220480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219480, "text": "Isn't that great?"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1224140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222000, "text": "You may be. For me, it's not so hard."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1230000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1228000, "text": "Oh, my chambers."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1232220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230980, "text": "My armadillo."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1235580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1234520, "text": "My nameplate."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1241100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1237860, "text": "Oh, you."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1245180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243160, "text": "Well, did you learn your lesson?"}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1246580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245580, "text": "I sure did."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1248880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247820, "text": "I'm glad I'm here."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1250600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249560, "text": "Life is good."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1255800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251040, "text": "No matter what curves or bumps might be\nin the path, I just gotta keep going."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1257840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256140, "text": "Ah, that's my Harry."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1262740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1258980, "text": "Level with me, Herb. If I had never come\nhere, would all that stuff really have"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1263740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1262740, "text": "happened?"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1267180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264080, "text": "Maybe, maybe not. But it worked, didn't\nit?"}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1268780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267780, "text": "Sure did."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1272580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1269720, "text": "I don't know how I can ever thank you."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1277090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273070, "text": "Hmm. Well, just take this little word of\nadvice, okay?"}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1278990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277990, "text": "Maestro."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1286510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282330, "text": "Nothing's impossible, I have found, when\nyour chin is on the ground. You pick"}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1290970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286510, "text": "yourself up, dust yourself off, start\nall over again. Oh, don't lose your"}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1295450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1290970, "text": "confidence. If you slip, be grateful for\nthe pleasant trip. Pick yourself up,"}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1297770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295470, "text": "dust yourself off, start again."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1301650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298210, "text": "Work like a soul inspired till the\nbattle of the day is won."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1306350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302270, "text": "You may be sick and tired, but you'll be\na man, my son."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1311630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306650, "text": "Will you remember the famous men had to\nfall to rise again? Take a deep breath."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1314190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312270, "text": "Dust yourself off."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1315810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314410, "text": "Take a deep breath."}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1320150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316170, "text": "Pick yourself up and start all over."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1322250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320870, "text": "Start all over."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1324050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322450, "text": "Start all over."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1331330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325070, "text": "Start all over."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1343820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342739, "text": "So long, kid."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1348640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347060, "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor. Five minutes are\nup."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1353400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1351080, "text": "We were wondering if you were going to\ncome back to the courtroom."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1356360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354720, "text": "Oh, you bet I am."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1358640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1357080, "text": "I love my job."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1360560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1359200, "text": "And I love you guys."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1361990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360990, "text": "Oh, really, I do."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1365770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362910, "text": "I mean it."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1368050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366990, "text": "Even you, Dan."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1370030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369030, "text": "Aw, shock."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1375530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1372650, "text": "Harry's back, and he's not crazy\nanymore."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1377730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375730, "text": "Excuse me. Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1379290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378290, "text": "Herb!"}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1381270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1379550, "text": "Who's Herb? I'm Mel."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1382930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1381930, "text": "Sure you are."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1388850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383490, "text": "Everybody, this is Herb. He's my\nguardian angel, and he sings, too."}
